Vehicle-specific data policy
The initial vehicle profile is a GCC-market Kia Sportage around 2019, 2.0 MPI petrol AWD, but the exact model year, engine code, transmission, market calibration and ECU IDs have not yet been verified. The app must onboard and identify the actual vehicle rather than assume this profile is exact.

