5.2 Kia enhanced diagnostics roadmap
Module	Initial support stance	Requirements to add
ECM/PCM	Standard OBD powertrain data first	Verified Kia-specific PIDs, ECU address, request/response format and applicability.
TCM	Do not assume generic ELM support	Vehicle-specific protocol and enhanced diagnostic definitions; safe read-only access.
