11. Test plan and acceptance criteria
11.1 Unit tests
•	ELM response normalisation: echoed command, prompt, CR/LF, NO DATA, STOPPED, ERROR, malformed bytes.
•	PID decoders: positive test vectors, short payload, extra bytes, invalid values and units.
•	DTC parsing: stored/pending/permanent, multiple codes, zero codes, malformed response.
•	ISO-TP multi-frame assembly and flow control if implemented.
•	Supported-PID bitmap parsing and recursive discovery.
•	Fuel and trip calculations with zero distance, missing MAF, invalid GPS and stale samples.
•	Data freshness transitions and reconnect state machine.
•	Room migrations and export serialization.
