ELM327 Bluetooth Classic	Pair/connect; initialise; read supported PIDs; disconnect cleanly.
Adapter clone / slow response	Timeout/retry logic; low-bandwidth mode; no command interleaving.
Vehicle ignition off	Graceful timeout; no false sensor values.
Engine running	Live values update; stale state when responses stop.
S24 Ultra portrait	No clipping/overlap; accessible text; all actions usable.
S24 Ultra landscape	Adaptive cockpit layout; panels resize and page navigation works.
Large landscape display	Map/telemetry split; no fixed pixel assumptions.
Waze installed / absent	Deep link opens Waze or gives fallback instructions.
No network / no Maps key	OBD and local features still work; map panel explains offline/unconfigured state.
Process recreation	Saved preferences and records remain; connection recovers safely.

11.3 Performance targets
•	No UI thread blocking from Bluetooth, database, chart rendering or parsing.
•	Dashboard remains responsive while telemetry is active.
•	Bounded log storage with configurable retention; avoid unbounded high-frequency raw data.
•	Battery use is measured in active and background modes.
•	Reconnect backoff prevents rapid repeated connection loops.
•	Charts downsample long histories for rendering without deleting raw stored data.
